{%- comment -%}
  TIKVES LONDON · BLACK FRIDAY BAND · 16 Nov 2026 · Barovo Red alone on wine red
  One section, two places.
  · The top of the Black Friday page (templates/page.black-friday.json):
    "Only in the Black Friday week" OFF. It always shows there, as the h1.
  · The homepage (templates/index.json): "Only in the Black Friday week" ON.
    It shows from Fri 27 Nov 00:00 to Thu 3 Dec 23:59 UK and at no other
    time. The dates are not here. They live in snippets/tl-dates.liquid,
    which sets html.tl-bf-live inside that window. The band is hidden by
    CSS without that class, so a cached page never shows it early or late.
    It also waits for the page it links to: while /pages/black-friday is
    unpublished the homepage band renders nothing, so it never links to a
    page nobody can open.
  · TEST COPIES ONLY: a template whose suffix contains "bftest" renders the
    homepage band before the page is published. The clock still applies;
    use ?tl_now=2026-11-28T10:00:00Z on a copy.

  HIS WORD, 15 Nov 2026, in chat: the flower panel look, Barovo Red as the
  bottle, headline "Black Friday at Tikveš London.", button "Shop Black
  Friday", the homepage band on the site clock, the gift card not named.
  Offer words from REF · BLACK FRIDAY 2026 v13 and its deltas.

  HIS WORD, 16 Nov 2026, in chat: the band takes the shape of Boom Beauty's
  Black Friday hero. The words sit on plain cream, not on a picture. Three
  tall panels stand side by side, one bottle in each, cut out, in front of
  a flower photograph. On the phone the panels come first and the words
  and the button sit under them. CLAUDE'S PICKS, HIS TO CHANGE: Babuna
  White, Barovo Red and Babuna Red as the three bottles, and the outlined
  button.

  HIS WORD, 16 Nov 2026, later the same day, in chat: the three flower
  panels did not look premium and come out. One locked picture takes their
  place: Barovo Red alone on wine red, BLACK FRIDAY in the picture above
  the bottle. REF · BLACK FRIDAY 2026 · THE BAND PICTURE IS BAROVO RED
  ALONE ON WINE RED · v1, in 00 · CANONICAL. The shape stays: words on
  cream, picture first on the phone, words left and picture right from
  769px, the outlined button.

  WORDS never on it: sale, deal, save, last chance, a countdown, a stock
  count, a price, a delivery promise.

  PICTURES: assets/bf-hero-barovo-phone.jpg (2340 x 2240) and, from
  769px, assets/bf-hero-barovo-desktop.jpg (2400 x 1800, 4 by 3), in the
  theme itself, so nothing has to be uploaded. Both carry BLACK FRIDAY in
  the picture. THE PICTURE IS SHOWN WHOLE, never cover-cropped: it keeps
  its own shape at every width, so the bottle, its shadow and the words in
  it always stay inside the frame. Pictures picked in the editor replace
  it and are shown whole too. With "Show the picture" off the band is Wine
  with Cream words. assets/bf-panel-1.jpg to bf-panel-3.jpg are no longer
  used; removing them is his to rule.

  THE BAROVO HERO, his word 15 Nov 2026: it is back on the homepage. While
  this band shows in the week it hides the section named in "Section it
  stands in for" (hero), and the hero returns by itself after the end.

  AFTER THE END, on the page only: once the clock passes the end of the
  week the offer lines hide and the "after" line shows, so a page left
  published by mistake never states an offer that has finished.
{%- endcomment -%}

{%- liquid
  assign s = section.settings
  assign bf_show = true
  if s.timed
    assign bf_show = false
    assign bf_page = pages[s.page_handle]
    if bf_page != blank and bf_page.url != blank
      assign bf_show = true
    endif
    assign bf_sfx = template.suffix | default: ''
    if bf_sfx contains 'bftest'
      assign bf_show = true
    endif
  endif
  assign htag = s.heading_tag | default: 'h2'
  assign bf_link = s.button_link | default: '/pages/black-friday'
  assign bf_prefix = section.id | split: '__' | first
  assign pic_d = s.image
  assign pic_m = s.image_mobile | default: s.image
  if pic_d != blank
    assign d_800 = pic_d | image_url: width: 800
    assign d_1200 = pic_d | image_url: width: 1200
    assign d_1600 = pic_d | image_url: width: 1600
    assign d_2000 = pic_d | image_url: width: 2000
    assign d_w = pic_d.width
    assign d_h = pic_d.height
    assign m_480 = pic_m | image_url: width: 480
    assign m_750 = pic_m | image_url: width: 750
    assign m_1080 = pic_m | image_url: width: 1080
    assign m_1500 = pic_m | image_url: width: 1500
    assign m_w = pic_m.width
    assign m_h = pic_m.height
  else
    assign d_800 = 'bf-hero-barovo-desktop.jpg' | asset_img_url: '800x'
    assign d_1200 = 'bf-hero-barovo-desktop.jpg' | asset_img_url: '1200x'
    assign d_1600 = 'bf-hero-barovo-desktop.jpg' | asset_img_url: '1600x'
    assign d_2000 = 'bf-hero-barovo-desktop.jpg' | asset_img_url: '2000x'
    assign d_w = 2400
    assign d_h = 1800
    assign m_480 = 'bf-hero-barovo-phone.jpg' | asset_img_url: '480x'
    assign m_750 = 'bf-hero-barovo-phone.jpg' | asset_img_url: '750x'
    assign m_1080 = 'bf-hero-barovo-phone.jpg' | asset_img_url: '1080x'
    assign m_1500 = 'bf-hero-barovo-phone.jpg' | asset_img_url: '1500x'
    assign m_w = 2340
    assign m_h = 2240
  endif
-%}

{%- if bf_show -%}
  <div class="tl-bfb{% if s.timed %} tl-bfb--timed{% endif %}{% unless s.show_picture %} tl-bfb--nopic{% endunless %}" data-tl-bfb>
    <div class="bfb__stage">
      {%- if s.show_picture -%}
        <picture class="bfb__pic">
          <source
            media="(min-width: 769px)"
            srcset="{{ d_800 }} 800w, {{ d_1200 }} 1200w, {{ d_1600 }} 1600w, {{ d_2000 }} 2000w"
            sizes="(min-width: 1800px) 1080px, 60vw"
            width="{{ d_w }}"
            height="{{ d_h }}">
          <img
            class="bfb__img"
            src="{{ m_750 }}"
            srcset="{{ m_480 }} 480w, {{ m_750 }} 750w, {{ m_1080 }} 1080w, {{ m_1500 }} 1500w"
            sizes="100vw"
            width="{{ m_w }}"
            height="{{ m_h }}"
            alt="{{ s.image_alt | escape }}"
            loading="eager"
            fetchpriority="high"
            decoding="async">
        </picture>
      {%- endif -%}
      <div class="bfb__words">
        <{{ htag }} class="bfb__head">{{ s.heading }}</{{ htag }}>
        {%- if s.line_1 != blank -%}<p class="bfb__line bfb__offer">{{ s.line_1 }}</p>{%- endif -%}
        {%- if s.line_2 != blank -%}<p class="bfb__line bfb__offer">{{ s.line_2 }}</p>{%- endif -%}
        {%- if s.after_text != blank and s.timed == false -%}<p class="bfb__line bfb__after">{{ s.after_text }}</p>{%- endif -%}
        {%- if s.button_label != blank -%}
          <a class="bfb__btn" href="{{ bf_link }}">{{ s.button_label }}</a>
        {%- endif -%}
      </div>
    </div>
    {%- if section.blocks.size > 0 -%}
      <nav class="bfb__jump" aria-label="{{ s.jump_label | escape }}">
        <ul>
          {%- for block in section.blocks -%}
            {%- if block.settings.label != blank and block.settings.key != blank -%}
              <li {{ block.shopify_attributes }}><a href="#shopify-section-{{ bf_prefix }}__{{ block.settings.key | strip }}">{{ block.settings.label }}</a></li>
            {%- endif -%}
          {%- endfor -%}
        </ul>
      </nav>
    {%- endif -%}
  </div>

  {%- unless s.timed -%}
    <script>
      (function () {
        try {
          if (window.TL && TL.now() > TL.dates.bfEnd) {
            document.querySelectorAll('[data-tl-bfb]').forEach(function (el) { el.classList.add('tl-bfb--over'); });
          }
        } catch (e) {}
      })();
    </script>
  {%- endunless -%}

  {%- style -%}
    .tl-bfb {
      --bf-paper: #F5EFE7; --bf-ink: #1F2328; --bf-wine: #4A0D18; --bf-stone: #B9AC9B;
      background: var(--bf-paper); color: var(--bf-ink);
    }
    .tl-bfb--timed { display: none; }
    html.tl-bf-live .tl-bfb--timed { display: block; }
    {%- if s.timed and s.hide_key != blank %}
    /* The week's band stands in for the usual hero. It comes back by itself when the clock leaves the week. */
    html.tl-bf-live [id^="shopify-section-"][id$="__{{ s.hide_key | strip }}"] { display: none !important; }
    {%- endif %}
    .tl-bfb h1, .tl-bfb h2, .tl-bfb p { text-transform: none; letter-spacing: 0; margin: 0; }
    .bfb__stage { display: flex; flex-direction: column; }
    /* The picture is shown whole at every width: its own shape, never cropped. */
    .bfb__pic { display: block; width: 100%; }
    .bfb__img { display: block; width: 100%; height: auto; }
    .bfb__words { padding: 22px 20px 28px; text-align: center; display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center; gap: 6px; }
    .bfb__head { font-family: var(--typeHeaderPrimary), var(--typeHeaderFallback); font-weight: 600; font-size: 26px; line-height: 1.15; margin-bottom: 6px !important; }
    .bfb__line { font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.45; }
    .bfb__after { display: none; }
    .tl-bfb--over .bfb__offer { display: none; }
    .tl-bfb--over .bfb__after { display: block; }
    .bfb__btn {
      display: block; width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; margin-top: 14px; padding: 15px 20px;
      background: transparent; color: var(--bf-ink); border: 1.5px solid var(--bf-ink);
      text-decoration: none; text-align: center;
      font-size: 13px; font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: 0.1em; text-transform: uppercase; line-height: 1.25;
    }
    .bfb__btn:hover { background: var(--bf-ink); color: var(--bf-paper); }
    .bfb__btn:focus-visible, .bfb__jump a:focus-visible { outline: 2px solid var(--bf-ink); outline-offset: 3px; }
    .tl-bfb--nopic .bfb__stage { background: var(--bf-wine); }
    .tl-bfb--nopic .bfb__words { color: var(--bf-paper); padding: 56px 20px; }
    .tl-bfb--nopic .bfb__btn { background: var(--bf-paper); color: var(--bf-ink); border-color: var(--bf-paper); }
    .bfb__jump { padding: 4px 12px 20px; }
    .bfb__jump ul { list-style: none; margin: 0; padding: 0; display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; justify-content: center; gap: 8px; }
    .bfb__jump li { margin: 0; }
    .bfb__jump a {
      display: block; padding: 10px 16px; border: 1px solid var(--bf-stone); border-radius: 999px;
      color: var(--bf-ink); text-decoration: none; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.2; min-height: 20px;
    }
    .bfb__jump a:hover { border-color: var(--bf-ink); }
    {%- if section.blocks.size > 0 %}
    [id^="shopify-section-{{ bf_prefix }}__"] { scroll-margin-top: 96px; }
    html { scroll-behavior: smooth; }
    @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) { html { scroll-behavior: auto; } }
    {%- endif %}
    @media (min-width: 769px) {
      .tl-bfb:not(.tl-bfb--nopic) .bfb__stage { flex-direction: row; align-items: center; justify-content: flex-end; }
      .tl-bfb:not(.tl-bfb--nopic) .bfb__pic { order: 2; flex: 0 0 auto; width: 60%; max-width: 1080px; }
      .tl-bfb:not(.tl-bfb--nopic) .bfb__words {
        order: 1; flex: 1 1 0; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; padding: 24px 4% 24px 7.6%;
        text-align: left; align-items: flex-start; justify-content: center; gap: 4px;
      }
      .bfb__head { font-size: clamp(28px, 3.1vw, 50px); line-height: 1.1; margin-bottom: 12px !important; }
      .bfb__line { font-size: clamp(15px, 1.25vw, 19px); }
      .bfb__btn { display: inline-block; width: auto; margin-top: 22px; padding: 16px 34px; font-size: 14px; }
      .tl-bfb--nopic .bfb__words { padding: 96px 24px; }
      .bfb__jump { padding: 20px 24px 8px; }
      .bfb__jump a { font-size: 15px; padding: 11px 20px; }
    }
  {%- endstyle -%}
{%- endif -%}

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "Black Friday band",
  "tag": "section",
  "settings": [
    { "type": "paragraph", "content": "The top of the Black Friday page, and the homepage band for the Black Friday week. The dates live in snippets/tl-dates." },
    { "type": "checkbox", "id": "timed", "label": "Only in the Black Friday week", "default": false, "info": "On for the homepage. It then shows only inside the week on the site clock, and only while the page below is published. Off for the Black Friday page itself." },
    { "type": "text", "id": "page_handle", "label": "Page it waits for", "default": "black-friday" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "hide_key", "label": "Section it stands in for", "info": "Homepage only. The key of the section to hide while this band shows, as written in the template: hero. Leave empty to hide nothing." },
    { "type": "select", "id": "heading_tag", "label": "Heading level", "options": [{ "value": "h1", "label": "h1" }, { "value": "h2", "label": "h2" }], "default": "h2", "info": "h1 on the Black Friday page. h2 on the homepage, which has its own h1." },
    { "type": "checkbox", "id": "show_picture", "label": "Show the picture", "default": true, "info": "Off gives a plain Wine band with Cream words." },
    { "type": "image_picker", "id": "image", "label": "A picture instead of the Barovo picture", "info": "Leave empty to use the theme's own Black Friday picture, assets/bf-hero-barovo-desktop.jpg from 769px and bf-hero-barovo-phone.jpg on the phone. A picture picked here is shown whole, never cropped." },
    { "type": "image_picker", "id": "image_mobile", "label": "That picture, for the phone", "info": "Only used when a picture is picked above. Leave empty to use the one above on the phone too." },
    { "type": "text", "id": "image_alt", "label": "Picture description", "default": "Black Friday. A bottle of Barovo Red on a deep red background." },
    { "type": "text", "id": "heading", "label": "Heading", "default": "Black Friday at Tikveš London." },
    { "type": "text", "id": "line_1", "label": "Line one", "default": "15% off every bottle, case and set." },
    { "type": "text", "id": "line_2", "label": "Line two", "default": "Until the end of Thursday 3 December." },
    { "type": "text", "id": "after_text", "label": "Line after the week has ended", "default": "Black Friday has finished. The range is below at its usual prices.", "info": "Black Friday page only." },
    { "type": "text", "id": "button_label", "label": "Button", "info": "Leave empty on the Black Friday page." },
    { "type": "url", "id": "button_link", "label": "Button link" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "jump_label", "label": "Name of the jump links, for screen readers", "default": "Jump to a part of the range" }
  ],
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "jump",
      "name": "Jump link",
      "settings": [
        { "type": "text", "id": "label", "label": "Label" },
        { "type": "text", "id": "key", "label": "Section key in the template", "info": "The key of the row it jumps to, as written in the page template: cases, sets, best, reds, whites, spirits." }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "presets": [{ "name": "Black Friday band" }]
}
{% endschema %}
